# BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` in preference to a root
# `.dockerignore`, so this trims the context for deploy/Dockerfile ONLY and
# cannot affect any other Dockerfile in the tree.
#
# Without it the context includes target/ (tens of GB on a dev box) and the
# `docker build` upload alone takes minutes.

target/
vendor/moon/target/
.planning/
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.add/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/*.gguf
**/*.safetensors
tmp/
docs/book/book/
*.log
